    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic, wide-angle event-focused visual of a futuristic, packed IPL 2026 cricket stadium in India at night. The stadium's giant screens display vibrant, real-time augmented reality graphics and data overlays, illustrating advanced broadcasting technologies like 5G and AI-driven analytics. Digital projections on the field and around the stands hint at immersive VR experiences. Above the stadium, subtle digital light streams extend outwards, symbolizing the IPL's global reach to countries like the United States, United Kingdom, Canada, and Australia, depicted as faint, glowing geographical outlines. The atmosphere is electric, capturing both the sporting spectacle and the technological innovation. The image should be unique, with a high-tech, slightly glossy finish, differentiating it from traditional sports photography. Avoid showing specific player faces clearly. Focus on the blend of sport and future tech.",
