    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual, abstract visual representing the 2026 Oscars. Focus on intertwined golden statues, one with a subtle glow of triumph, another slightly shadowed to imply a 'snub' or controversy. Incorporate subtle, ethereal elements of starlight or celestial bodies to hint at 'Chasing Starlight' and the sci-fi win. Use a sophisticated color palette of deep blues, golds, and subtle purples. The composition should convey both prestige and underlying tension, avoiding literal depiction of celebrities or a stage. Emphasize light and shadow play to symbolize winners and controversies, with a distinct, dynamic, and non-generic feel.",
