    { question: "How are India-US trade talks affecting the stock market?", answer: "The ongoing trade talks are viewed as a positive development for India’s export-driven sectors. A favorable agreement could reduce trade barriers, boosting corporate earnings and market sentiment." },
    { question: "What should investors watch for in the coming months?", answer: "Investors should keep an eye on the NSE IPO, Q2 corporate earnings, and the outcome of India-US trade talks. These factors will likely shape market performance in the second half of 2026." }
