    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual of a gentle downward spiral of hair strands, subtly hinting at loss and concern. In the blurred background, a very faint, abstract silhouette of a GLP-1 injection pen or pill bottle. The color palette should be soft, muted, and thoughtful, using tones like light grays, subtle blues, and soft browns to convey a sense of introspection rather than alarm. The composition should feel balanced and not overly dramatic, focusing on the abstract idea of 'emerging concern' with popular medications. Avoid any direct, clinical, or overly graphic depictions of hair loss.",
